      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**উদাহরণ ৬.** $A = \\{a, b\\}$ এবং $B = \\{b, c\\}$ হলে দেখাও যে, $P(A) \\cup P(B) \\subseteq P(A \\cup B)$।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "A = \\{a, b\\}",
        "B = \\{b, c\\}",
        "P(A) \\cup P(B) \\subseteq P(A \\cup B)"
