      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**সমাধান:** এখানে, $P(A) = \\{\\emptyset, \\{a\\}, \\{b\\}, \\{a, b\\}\\}$, $P(B) = \\{\\emptyset, \\{b\\}, \\{c\\}, \\{b, c\\}\\}$।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "P(A) = \\{\\emptyset, \\{a\\}, \\{b\\}, \\{a, b\\}\\}",
        "P(B) = \\{\\emptyset, \\{b\\}, \\{c\\}, \\{b, c\\}\\}"
